abstract: >-
  Continuity Calculus is a proposed systems and governance discipline for preserving
  data, meaning, context, authority, operational state, and verification across time,
  transformations, handoffs, systems, and agents. This release is theoretical and
  exploratory and does not claim certification, regulatory compliance, mathematical
  completeness, production deployment, or independent external assurance.
